        "title": "Lung rui tingkau ramta ninga",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lung rui tingkau ramta ninga,",
            "Kandih rianra khang ngam mei guai;",
            "Neilana bam mei 7#@ hou e,",
            "Neilamei lukhuan jangmei 7#@,",
            "Tingmik thui ai suan bam sini,",
            "Khou 7#@ guangtang khang khuan ngam mak.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Jaukei lou o tingkau guang dai,",
            "Ai hei rianra naangmei 7#@ e,",
            "Ata pap riang rui banglou e,",
            "Nang ram khou 7#@ guang nisini,",
            "Theimei le rianramei ruina,",
            "Tingmik thui ata duam.",
            "",
            "2. Lung rui ninga guang tang numak,",
            "Theimei hei tinai lou khou rui;",
            "Rianra rianriumei rui guam liam,",
            "Tangkhang khuan ngam makpui jangrui,",
            "Poubaumei nang bam gaimei 7#@,",
            "",
            "3. Tingmik kathui ai rui ninga,",
            "Ai rui rianramei hei thai na;",
            "Akhang rianra sang khang na de,",
            "Kap bammei hei lung neila khang,",
            "Kandih khou hei phung ngammak ge,",
            "Tingmik thui ninga bam sini.",
            "",
            "",
            "4. Alau kumma kap bammei hei,",
            "Poubaumei rui lathao mak san;",
            "Ai rui rianramei man lakkhe,",
            "Apanti hei nai bam san khou,",
            "Tingkau kandih la ngam makge,",
            "Poubaumei ai guangtang ngammak."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
